{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have what it takes to ascend to the highest rank of the world's first totally random eSport? If you have $10, the answer to that question is yes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730790/extras/a8101ac54d486a0bb48f3d063926de4b.avif?t=1757537546\" width=620 height=425 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 8 playable heroes, each with their own unique skills and abilities</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4v4 team-based competition</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with your friends, Solo-Q, or play the whole game single-player against bots</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 200 Items to discover and build around\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 400 skills to unlock</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique geometric trigger-based skill combo system</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1.38 \u00d7 10\u00b9\u00b9\u00b2 ways to play!\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730790/extras/f575b6e2d92676cd80762b4fae721571.poster.avif?t=1757537546\" width=614 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730790/extras/f575b6e2d92676cd80762b4fae721571.webm?t=1757537546\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730790/extras/f575b6e2d92676cd80762b4fae721571.mp4?t=1757537546\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However you play, you'll experience the heart-stopping thrills of our patented, mathematically-perfect, quantum-powered matchmaking system. Will you make it to the top of the ladder or be trapped forever in Q-Lo hell? Don't ask me! Buy the game and find out!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730790/extras/9ac82ee577816f4414dc107a2ef3074a.poster.avif?t=1757537546\" width=614 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730790/extras/9ac82ee577816f4414dc107a2ef3074a.webm?t=1757537546\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730790/extras/9ac82ee577816f4414dc107a2ef3074a.mp4?t=1757537546\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the twisted minds that brought you Universal Paperclips and Babble Royale comes a timeless tale about numbers going up and going down, the thrill of victory and the agony of defeat, reverse mergers, spooky action at a distance, and a 3-ton whale with a day job. </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3730790?t=1757537546","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730790/956f3a107d99046b326d75e9e1ba682ac455e57e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757537546","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730790/f6e429e3806257bdb8aa6a5b57858cd12c966058/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757537546","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730790/f6e429e3806257bdb8aa6a5b57858cd12c966058/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757537546","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"descri